==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þak|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|þakan|lang=gem-pro}}, cognate with English {{term|thatch|lang=en}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{recons|teg-|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θaːk/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aːk|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|þaks|þök}}

# a [[roof]]

